with requests.post(url, stream=True) as r:
    resume = r.headers.get('X-Redwood-Resume-Token')
    for line in r.iter_lines():
        if line:
            print(line)
            # parse partial, save resume token
```
I'll add retry/backoff snippet using tenacity.
sophia: Go draft:
```go
ctx, cancel := context.WithTimeout(context.Background(), 10*time.Second)
defer cancel()
req = http.NewRequestWithContext(ctx, "POST", url, body)
resp, _ := http.DefaultClient.Do(req)
cursor := resp.Header.Get("X-Redwood-Resume-Token")
ch := make(chan string)
go func() {
  scanner := bufio.NewScanner(resp.Body)
  for scanner.Scan() { ch <- scanner.Text() }
  close(ch)
}()
for msg := range ch { fmt.Println(msg) }
```
I'll tidy error handling before PR.
